SY_TALK("eTMYRiDhz_g",[[2,["…that has to be first realised – what","is your category."]],[6,["And if you are that category, of the category","which is seeking beyond what you have and"]],[22,["that you are not satisfied with what you have","already, then you are the category of seekers"]],[36,["who have been seeking something that is very","subtle, that is not gross, not intelligible"]],[47,["through your sensory organs."]],[50,["How it happens within us – it is very interesting","to see."]],[56,["Within us, as I have told you, there are these","subtle centres which have developed through"]],[66,["the process of our evolution."]],[70,["Through the process of our evolution we have","become human beings."]],[77,["While we were becoming human beings, all these","centres have been also evolving within us."]],[86,["These centres are placed in the spinal cord,","in the centre of the spinal cord, and they"]],[97,["manifest outside grossly on [the] physical","level, as plexuses."]],[101,["As they are evolving inside, also the outside,","the gross plexuses are also evolving."]],[114,["For example, animals do not insure their lives,","do they?"]],[120,["They have fear."]],[123,["They know how to react to a fear but they","do not know how to insure."]],[132,["After some time the animals forget their children."]],[139,["Animals can pass through any filth, any dirt,","any untidiness."]],[144,["They don’t understand tidiness, neatness."]],[148,["Animals do not organise."]],[153,["Animals don’t plan."]],[160,["They do sometimes when they have to catch","hold of a prey, but that too, not too far."]],[167,["Like we have five-year plans, ten-year plans,","twenty-year plans as the human being have."]],[173,["They do not put any energy into that."]],[175,["The reason for all this is that man has evolved","much more than all the animals put together."]],[192,["He is an evolved soul."]],[198,["Now these evolved souls have also got a category","of greater evolved people who are not satisfied"]],[211,["with the general norms of life."]],[217,["For example, there are people who are interested","say, in having power."]],[227,["And they want to have power."]],[228,["Till they die they want to have power."]],[232,["Till they die they won’t give a resignation."]],[234,["I mean, sometimes they put one foot in the","grave and still the resignation in the another"]],[239,["hand, in case they do not die and they have","to pull out the leg, so it’s better to keep"]],[244,["it handy!"]],[245,["There are people who stick on to other games","of life, like money."]],[255,["They are money-oriented people."]],[258,["They find their securities in money."]],[260,["They run after money."]],[261,["They plan out everything according to money."]],[264,["All their lives they are doing that."]],[267,["There are [a] third type of people who indulge","into so-called love affairs and things like"]],[276,["that; into emotional movements of their mind."]],[283,["But there are some others who think that these","things are not so interesting for them."]],[297,["So the fourth category takes to religion – to","know about beyond."]],[302,["They read about the prophets, the great scriptures,","all the great religions of the world."]],[314,["But as the pioneer of the religion dies, the","followers, somehow or other, built in fanaticism"]],[328,["around them and fanaticism is the death of","religion, is absolutely the death of religion."]],[339,["I have seen people who get cancer are sometimes","fanatics."]],[349,["If you could cure their fanaticism, you can","cure their cancer because all such false identification"]],[362,["requires extra energy in a man."]],[366,["He has to stick on to some sort of obstinacy!"]],[369,["Now supposing I am holding on to it (the microphone)","and I do not want to leave my hand from here"]],[375,["– for nothing at all!"]],[377,["I say, “No, I am not going to leave.\""]],[378,["“No!"]],[379,["This is the thing I believe into."]],[380,["I am going to stick on to it!”"]],[385,["Then I require a lot of energy to hold on","to it."]],[389,["But if I could be free and see, it is better."]],[393,["Like I remember a gentleman fell down from","the sixteenth story and he was asking for"]],[399,["help and help."]],[402,["And he saw people passing from the back."]],[404,["He was holding onto one of the rails, and","he could not understand how the people are"]],[410,["passing around."]],[411,["He said, “Help for what?”"]],[412,["He said, “I’m falling.\""]],[414,["They said, “Where?"]],[415,["Here is the road!”"]],[417,["He had, just near the road, had caught hold","of the rod!"]],[421,["And he was asking for help, and he was just","shouting."]],[423,["When they said, “This is the road."]],[424,["You better put your foot down.\""]],[426,["he fainted!"]],[428,["Because he had put all his energy into a nonsensical","thing, believing into a myth."]],[436,["And myth always takes away your energy, while","the Truth enriches your energy."]],[447,["Because you don’t have to hold on to the","Truth, the Truth carries you along."]],[453,["Any kind of fanaticism is not your way, as","I told you yesterday."]],[462,["And if anybody is a fanatic, then he is not","seeker."]],[466,["Because he’s found whatever it is."]],[470,["He has to deal with his fanaticism and his","faiths."]],[474,["So the another category of people are there","which are anti everything: everything that"]],[482,["is established."]],[483,["Anything."]],[484,["Christ – they are against Christ."]],[490,["Anything."]],[492,["They are reactionaries."]],[495,["They are against Nanak Saheb, they are against","Mohammed Saheb."]],[498,["They are against everything that has been","established because whatever is established"]],[504,["is not true."]],[505,["Those who have established have taken a mythical","attitude."]],[511,["When they take up a mythical attitude and","they try to stick onto it, those who think"]],[527,["about it are shocked and they think, “These","are drunk people."]],[531,["These are possessed people!”"]],[533,["So they say, “Alright, that we are not!”"]],[534,["So we become atheist."]],[536,["We don’t believe in God."]],[538,["We don’t believe in any spiritual power."]],[541,["We do not believe in any divine power."]],[544,["We do not believe in anything that is said","before."]],[551,["According to them, all prophets were wrong."]],[553,["All religions are wrong."]],[555,["There is no God – [they think they are]","the wisest people every born!"]],[560,["So there is another category of extra-wise."]],[563,["You can call them intellectuals."]],[565,["These days I don’t know what you call them."]],[570,["This is another category."]],[575,["Now there is another very subtle category,","which tries to exploit all these things that"]],[585,["are existing."]],[587,["Some of them do it because they do believe","that they have found out something new, like"]],[594,["psychologist, like Freud."]],[597,["They are ignorant, absolutely half-baked people."]],[605,["They do not know the whole thing."]],[607,["They just know a part of it and to them that’s","the truth."]],[611,["Like you find a needle somewhere and say the","needle is the whole world."]],[617,["They know very little and they don’t know","what to do with the needle, and so they come"]],[622,["out with the needle, saying, “Needle is","the world!”"]],[626,["And such people are very anxious to write","books and convey their messages to the world"]],[632,["and communicate to the whole world what they","have found out, while whatever they have found"]],[639,["out is nothing but just a few drops of truth."]],[649,["And they are trying their level best to spoil","[it]."]],[654,["Now there is a category of another people","which are sinister."]],[661,["In that you know so many types which I do","not want to discuss here."]],[665,["From Hitler you can start, all kinds of brutal","people and all that."]],[669,["They go parallel with all these categories."]],[671,["But I would say the worst of all are those","who try to make money in the name of God,"]],[679,["and worse than that, the worst of all, are","the people who try to play games with God."]],[689,["Those who take money are openly bad but those","who try to play with your Kundalini, with"]],[699,["your Realisation, are really to be called","as demonic categories."]],[705,["And all such people should know, as Blake","has said, that they will go to the hell from"]],[713,["where they can never rise."]],[716,["Now whether you believe it or not, there is","God."]],[722,["Sahaja Yoga is a thing today which has reached","that stage where the category of people who"]],[732,["are men of God, they do not proclaim on the","streets that, “I am a man of God.\""]],[738,["No."]],[739,["They do not stand up with banners in their","hands that, “I am the man of God.\""]],[745,["They are very normal people."]],[746,["They are householders."]],[748,["They have children."]],[749,["They have grandchildren."]],[751,["They are very simple people."]],[752,["They lead a very ordinary life."]],[755,["They are not very successful people."]],[757,["But they are people, men of God."]],[763,["And these human beings of God are the ones","I am talking about, is the category you people"]],[772,["are."]],[774,["If you are not that category, Sahaja Yoga","is not going to work on you to begin with."]],[780,["Later on, when we have a particular number","of people, the evolution will take such a"]],[788,["dynamic form, that thousands of people will","receive their Self-realisation."]],[796,["Now the Self-realisation is the thing in which","an ordinary man who looks an ordinary common"]],[803,["person but who is actually a seeker, a true","seeker, not a false seeker but a true seeker,"]],[813,["receives the grace of the Divine and becomes","a prophet."]],[819,["He becomes a prophet."]],[823,["This is what Sahaja Yoga is, that it makes","you a prophet and a prophet of a very unique"]],[833,["style, because the job of today’s modern","prophets is very different from the prophets"]],[841,["which came before, as I told you yesterday."]],[846,["The prophets who came before, as we celebrated","yesterday, Guru Nanaka’s birthday and Mohammed"]],[854,["Saheb and all others, like Moses, Abraham","and all these, was to maintain your sustenance"]],[861,["through giving you Ten Commandments."]],[866,["And these Ten Commandments exist in that centre","there, where you see the green centre."]],[872,["You can see it very clearly in your stomach."]],[874,["The religion is in your stomach."]],[876,["It’s a thing built within you."]],[879,["It is not that I can give you a lecture about","religion."]],[882,["But it is built within you."]],[883,["It is inside you."]],[887,["And this religion is to be maintained, was","to be maintained that time; very important"]],[894,["was that people should know what helps them","to be a human being."]],[901,["And that was the job of all these prophets","and they did it very well."]],[907,["But their disciples and maybe their followers","made them into fanatic religions."]],[915,["You can’t help it."]],[916,["I mean, I have always said that they were","like living flowers on this Earth, who came"]],[921,["one after another on the Tree of Life."]],[924,["And people just plucked those flowers and","said, “This is mine."]],[928,["This is mine.\""]],[929,["The flowers became dead, ugly and useless."]],[934,["That is how fanaticism has prospered."]],[937,["And all the fanaticism in these modern times","is [now] challenged."]],[945,["Everywhere people can see it that it is not","logical to be fanatic."]],[949,["But as a result of ego activity in thinking","they go to another extreme by which they condemn"]],[960,["even the real flowers, even the originators,","the ones who came on this Earth."]],[967,["This is going too far from the right point."]],[969,["From one extreme to another extreme they are","moving."]],[974,["Now the specialty of the modern prophets is","that you can make other people prophets."]],[984,["That means you can give them Realisation yourself."]],[987,["This is the difference between the Sahaja","Yoga that worked out at the time of other"]],[994,["people."]],[995,["That’s why there was hardly one or two Realised-souls."]],[998,["At the time of Janaka – say about eight","thousand years back when Shri Rama was ruling,"]],[1006,["his father-in-law, who was a great prophet","– he had one disciple whom he gave Realisation."]],[1013,["And with very great tests and all that he","took under his own guidance."]],[1019,["He gave him Realisation."]],[1021,["But today the time has changed because the","Life’s Tree has increased, has reach to"]],[1030,["that state of maturity, where thousands of","you have to be transformed."]],[1032,["It has to be done."]],[1034,["It’s the God’s plan."]],[1038,["And those who fit into it are the people who","are of the category who are seeking."]],[1043,["Now, such category can be understood by many","ways and there are some tests to understand"]],[1055,["what these people are."]],[1058,["It may be that such people could be extremely","nervous people, could be, because they cannot"]],[1065,["bear the unrighteous, sinful, deceitful world."]],[1069,["The whole atmosphere may be jarring them."]],[1076,["That’s why they are very shaky."]],[1080,["Could be they might be very nervous because","of that."]],[1083,["They could be a people who might be a recluses."]],[1087,["They might be people who might be hot-tempered."]],[1092,["They might be people who are escapists."]],[1095,["They could be the people who could be druggist."]],[1097,["Could be alcoholic."]],[1100,["They could be anything, because they are running","away from the so-called horrible ‘reality’."]],[1111,["Sahaja Yoga is a thing which establishes your","reality within yourself, by which you feel"]],[1116,["secure, because your reality is beauty, it","is joy."]],[1123,["And then you don’t want to run away from","that."]],[1128,["This is what we have to understand, that we","are here to receive our reality, to know ourselves."]],[1138,["By knowing ourselves, how many things can","happen to us, you have no idea."]],[1142,["The whole property that you are, the whole","wealth that you are, the whole beauty that"]],[1150,["you are, becomes your own."]],[1153,["You become the master of your own being."]],[1155,["This is the first thing that should happen:","means your ill health must get alright."]],[1161,["You know that there are people here who had","very serious diseases, who got completely"]],[1166,["cured."]],[1167,["You know there are people who have mental","problems, who had epilepsies and things – they"]],[1171,["are cured."]],[1172,["And how it happens?"]],[1174,["Just by knowing yourself, how powerful you","are."]],[1177,["Just think of that!"]],[1179,["Think of your own powers that, just by knowing","yourself, how you have become so powerful."]],[1186,["But this knowledge is not through your rationality,","that, “I am such."]],[1191,["I am Napoleon."]],[1192,["I am this.\""]],[1195,["This kind of a knowledge is really stupid,","it’s egoistical."]],[1200,["But this knowledge is a dynamism in your own","awareness."]],[1207,["It’s a new perception within you by which","you become something."]],[1213,["You become a different person."]],[1215,["You become a higher, evolved soul."]],[1220,["And then you realise that you have suddenly","become a being who is collectively conscious."]],[1228,["Some progress very fast but some do not."]],[1232,["Some progress tremendously fast."]],[1234,["I know of a gentlemen who was supposed to","be a drunkard and used to waste all his money"]],[1241,["in races and he did all kinds of things."]],[1245,["He used to smoke like a chimney."]],[1249,["And when he got his Realisation, the whole","room was filled with fragrance."]],[1254,["And everybody said, “This man?"]],[1256,["How can we believe, Mother?"]],[1258,["He is this and this and this.\""]],[1259,["I said, “But this is what it is!"]],[1263,["This was all the clouds upon him."]],[1266,["And all the clouds have gone away and you","see the sun coming in him."]],[1270,["He’s a different man.\""]],[1272,["I don’t believe in the clouds, I believe","in the sun."]],[1273,["If I see the sun, the sun is there."]],[1277,["I don’t see the clouds at all."]],[1279,["I see the sun."]],[1280,["Perhaps I have more penetrating eyes than","you have."]],[1281,["And I see the sun in the man."]],[1284,["He has risen out of that."]],[1286,["And now he is shining like a sun."]],[1288,["So accept him and bow to him."]],[1291,["He’s the one who was seeking, really, within."]],[1293,["He thought that by playing races he’ll find","joy."]],[1296,["He thought by eating food like that he will","have joy, or by smoking like that he will"]],[1302,["have joy."]],[1303,["But he never was satisfied within himself."]],[1305,["He never got involved into it to that extent","that he lost his own being and his seeking"]],[1311,["and that’s how he is the one who is a true","seeker."]],[1316,["Sometimes it is some shocking to see in Sahaja","Yoga how people get transformed just like"]],[1323,["that."]],[1324,["Just the change starts coming, as if some","magic has happened in the person’s life"]],[1328,["and he changes."]],[1329,["But actually it is very simple to understand."]],[1333,["When it rains and the whole place is so foggy,","you don’t feel like going out anywhere:"]],[1342,["it’s so grey, you feel so horrible."]],[1345,["But when the sun comes out, everyone, children,","old people, young people, the housewives,"]],[1352,["all of them come out to greet the sun."]],[1356,["When your sun comes out and you see your brilliance","yourself and then, “Oh, it’s me!"]],[1365,["Is it me?"]],[1367,["Oh, God!”"]],[1369,["And that starts transforming."]],[1371,["And you are amazed to see yourself the way","you are transformed."]],[1374,["That has to happen for you."]],[1376,["But for this, already God has planned within","you all these things very beautifully."]],[1382,["As beautifully as He has made your exterior,","He has made your interior equally beautifully,"]],[1387,["very delicately and with very great, very","great care."]],[1391,["Within you lies the Kundalini, in the triangular","bone, the sacred bone called as sacrum, which"]],[1399,["gives you Realisation."]],[1401,["This is one about which Christ has said, “I","will appear before you like tongues of flames.\""]],[1410,["What is that?"]],[1414,["Every person has talked about him, but the","trouble is, how will you explain tongues of"]],[1425,["flames?"]],[1426,["Kabira has talked so clearly."]],[1428,["He has said, “Ida, Pingala, Sushumna.\""]],[1430,["Everything he has talked about, he talked","about Kundalini!"]],[1438,["Shankaracharya has talked about."]],[1442,["I would say Blake, William Blake."]],[1444,["You read him."]],[1445,["You will be amazed!"]],[1446,["He’s talking of today in his book, “Milton”."]],[1448,["He is talking of Jerusalem of today."]],[1451,["This place, this England, is going to be the","Jerusalem, is the pilgrimage, where the people"]],[1460,["of God are going to be the prophets."]],[1463,["He has talked of today!"]],[1465,["Can you imagine?"]],[1466,["He was not very old; he was not very ancient,","very modern."]],[1470,["He has prophesised about these days and it","is happening."]],[1475,["You don’t have to worry about these things."]],[1479,["It is God’s plan that He has done it so","well, and individually all of you have got"]],[1485,["this Kundalini in your triangular bone, called","‘sacrum’."]],[1489,["See, the word ‘sacrum’ means ‘sacred’."]],[1492,["How did they know, the word ‘sacrum’ to","be put for this, is a sacred bone?"]],[1497,["This was discovered in ancient times, long,","long time back."]],[1503,["Even they say that Indra was given Realisation","by Dattatreya."]],[1509,["To that extent!"]],[1510,["I mean, how many years back it was done!"]],[1512,["But it was a guarded secret."]],[1514,["It was done for very few people."]],[1518,["Only it was Shankaracharya who started first."]],[1520,["Adi Shankaracharya I would say, not these","[modern ones]."]],[1523,["But the Adi Shankaracharya started talking","about it so clearly."]],[1527,["Everywhere you find, even in Koran or in the","Bible, everywhere it is said, any scripture"]],[1537,["which has lasted the time, it’s said that,","“You are to be born again.\""]],[1548,["Now people have taken a note from that and","they certify, “I am a twice-born.\""]],[1550,["Now what is the proof that you are twice-born?"]],[1552,["Everybody says, “I am a twice-born.\""]],[1557,["It is absurd."]],[1560,["What do you mean by twice-born?"]],[1561,["As I have told you before that a bird is called","as twice-born in Sanskrit language, and a"]],[1568,["Realised-soul is also called a twice-born."]],[1574,["As the bird is an egg and, when the egg breaks,","we do not see the egg but we see the chick"]],[1585,["coming out of it."]],[1587,["In the same way it has to happen to you that,","when your egg, which is made by the formation"]],[1595,["of ego and superego, the yellow and the blue","on your head, has to break and then you become"]],[1603,["a new personality, a personality which is","very different from what it was before."]],[1611,["Egg doesn’t grow, does it?"]],[1617,["But the chick grows."]],[1619,["Now the growth starts in the spiritual arena,","in the spiritual understanding, into spiritual"]],[1625,["education."]],[1626,["Now it starts!"]],[1628,["Not before that."]],[1632,["You start feeling the Divine Power around","and you understand that you are a universal"]],[1638,["being."]],[1639,["All these nonsensical ideas, of race, of different","religions, of different communities, are products"]],[1651,["of human endeavour, or we should say the human","thinking; which is so stupid sometimes that"]],[1660,["it is impossible for a person like me to understand","why we have to carry a passport from places"]],[1665,["to places."]],[1667,["The God Almighty also must be failing to understand","how this has been worked out by the great"]],[1675,["wise human beings."]],[1677,["That He made only one world."]],[1680,["He didn’t make many worlds."]],[1683,["He just put some rivers and some nice mountains","and some hills and dales, to make it a beautiful,"]],[1692,["interesting place for you."]],[1693,["And you have divided into nations and into","cities and villages and then into smaller"]],[1704,["places and then into a road and then into","your houses and then into your kitchen."]],[1712,["That’s what we have become!"]],[1718,["But the category of the people about whom","I am saying, they can’t remain in their"]],[1724,["kitchens, they can’t remain in their houses,","they cannot remain in their nations."]],[1731,["They transcend the whole Universe."]],[1734,["They cover the whole Universe."]],[1737,["Because they become universal beings."]],[1740,["They cannot think in this terminology."]],[1742,["It hurts them."]],[1744,["It hurts them."]],[1745,["You see, it would be like a great person being","put in a sack."]],[1750,["You just force him to get into a sack or into","a cup – how he’ll be hurt?"]],[1757,["Either the cup will break or the fellow will","throw it away."]],[1761,["It’s the ocean you are trying to put it","into a cup, which you cannot do it."]],[1767,["And such a stupidity has been done so far."]],[1772,["But the time has come for all the oceans to","be awakened to their greatness."]],[1777,["And once they are awakened they will throw","away all these minor boundaries and all these"]],[1787,["nonsensical barriers that has created such","a mountain from one seed to another seed where"]],[1798,["two beautiful human beings are sitting and","are fragrant with the fragrance of universal"]],[1808,["joy."]],[1809,["After Realisation only you can also enjoy","another personality."]],[1814,["Normally you cannot."]],[1816,["What you enjoy is his car, or his house or","his dress or his looks or his behaviour towards"]],[1826,["you."]],[1827,["At the most his intellect, his success, his","horses."]],[1832,["I don’t know what else."]],[1835,["But after Realisation you just enjoy his vibrations!"]],[1839,["You just enjoy him in his innate thing."]],[1843,["You do not see his age, you do not see his","caste, you do not see his race but you see"]],[1848,["all this chaitanya, these vibrations, coming","from the person and you just enjoy for hours"]],[1854,["together just feeling that."]],[1857,["It’s so enjoyable."]],[1858,["One person like that walks in, and all of","you, “Ah!”"]],[1863,["This should happen to everyone."]],[1867,["It has to happen."]],[1871,["The time has come for this happening."]],[1873,["That’s why we have so many seekers."]],[1879,["They have been ill-treated, they have been","deceived, they have been used, people have"]],[1886,["made money out of them."]],[1888,["I accept [that]."]],[1891,["But then I have to accept also that in seeking","you had to be tested also, to see where do"]],[1899,["you stick on."]],[1902,["If you want to go to the Truth, you will discard","everything [else]."]],[1906,["And once you come before the Truth you will","have it."]],[1909,["And that’s why this testing has to be done,","because there is ego, human beings have their"]],[1917,["egos; they think, “Oh I will do this."]],[1919,["I can do it."]],[1920,["I can sort it out.\""]],[1922,["Alright."]],[1923,["God says, “Alright, have it."]],[1925,["Have it your way.\""]],[1926,["Then they will go and break their heads, break","their legs, break their hands and then come"]],[1931,["saying that, “Mother, see, I have broken","everything."]],[1933,["Now what will you do?”"]],[1934,["So alright!"]],[1935,["The Sahaja Yoga has to work it out."]],[1937,["But why do all that?"]],[1940,["Come straight to the Truth."]],[1943,["Now, one has to understand that before Realisation","you don’t have to do anything, but after"]],[1950,["Realisation those who do not understand their","own esteem, they do not value their potentialities"]],[1960,["or their powers, can lose their vibrations","in the early months."]],[1972,["It has happened with many people: they have","lost their vibrations completely because they"]],[1977,["have not paid any attention to themselves."]],[1978,["They have not tried to improve themselves."]],[1981,["They have not tried to keep up the vibrations."]],[1983,["It’s like enlightening any light."]],[1985,["We have to look after it for a while till","it takes its own form."]],[1992,["And that is how in Sahaja Yoga so many come","and get Realisation, but those who grow are"]],[1999,["the real Sahaja yogis."]],[2001,["The rest of them are wasted, are just wasted."]],[2004,["They’ll come back again but they take too","much time and the Divine does not have interest"]],[2010,["in such people, it does not help such people."]],[2014,["So I have to request to you, request you that","if you are seekers, you have to have your"]],[2022,["Realisation."]],[2023,["Without that you will not be happy."]],[2024,["But you must have full idea and responsibility","about yourself that you are now an enlightened"]],[2035,["light."]],[2036,["You are a beacon and you cannot afford to","hide yourself."]],[2042,["You have to give light to others."]],[2044,["You have to work it out that way."]],[2046,["It’s not now a question of only one Christ","bearing the cross or one Mohammed talking"]],[2056,["about the message or one Nanaka fighting the","whole world."]],[2060,["It’s all of you put together have to fight","it out and work it out."]],[2065,["That’s what it is today."]],[2066,["That’s why Sahaja Yoga, one can say, has","reached the state of Mahayoga."]],[2071,["“Sahaja”, Sahaja means born with you."]],[2075,["It’s spontaneous."]],[2077,["It is within you."]],[2080,["The whole thing is within you."]],[2082,["Just like a seed sprouts, the Kundalini sprouts","spontaneously."]],[2086,["You do not have to do anything about it."]],[2088,["But when it becomes Mahayoga, means it becomes","en masse, thousands of people can be given"]],[2096,["Realisation."]],[2097,["In India we have someone who has given Realisation","to ten thousand people in a village!"]],[2105,["He is just a farmer and he has done it."]],[2109,["So you can imagine how much you can do."]],[2113,["But in the West, as I have always warned you,","it’s a very ego-oriented society, and people"]],[2120,["are very exclusive."]],[2122,["Everybody wants to sort out."]],[2123,["Immediately after Realisation everybody becomes","an Archbishop of Canterbury!"]],[2126,["And they think no end of themselves."]],[2134,["You have to have spiritual knowledge after","this."]],[2138,["You have to know everything about it."]],[2140,["You have to master it."]],[2143,["You have to master your body, you have to","master your mind and you have to master the"]],[2148,["whole art of Kundalini."]],[2150,["Then only you can say that it works."]],[2154,["Otherwise, it’s just a waste."]],[2158,["You are the people who are in the foundation,","and you have to be the strongest people."]],[2164,["You have to be the masters of Kundalini, absolutely","the masters of Kundalini."]],[2169,["It’s not individual."]],[2170,["This is Mahayoga."]],[2173,["Anybody who tries to be individualistic will","be lost, will be no more in the circulation."]],[2179,["This I have told you hundred, and hundred","and one times."]],[2184,["And the Spirit can only grow in collectivity","because the nature of Spirit is universal."]],[2194,["You cannot achieve anything exclusively."]],[2196,["Those who try it will fail."]],[2200,["You all have to join together and should know","that you all awakened people."]],[2209,["In the Primordial Being you are like the awakened","cells who know the Primordial Being and who"]],[2218,["have the powers by which they can communicate","the powers of God to other people."]],[2227,["You all have to be absolutely one with each","other, not to find faults but to love and"]],[2236,["enjoy each other."]],[2237,["That’s the best way you can move."]],[2241,["As you know that this subject is so varied,","and it requires so much of explanation, for"]],[2250,["which now we have lots of tapes, and if you","people want you can get tapes from Douglas"]],[2256,["(Fry), who has really put in lot of effort","for it."]],[2259,["You can play them and can understand and can","improve all your knowledge about Sahaja Yoga."]],[2270,["And now I’ll be going to India and perhaps","there may be only one lecture more where it"]],[2276,["will be just a farewell function we’ll have."]],[2281,["I would like some of the Sahaja Yogis to ask","some questions today, because it’s a nice"]],[2287,["opportunity for you to ask some questions."]],[2291,["But not the people who haven’t got Realisation,","because those who haven’t got Realisation"]],[2295,["are not entitled because they do not know."]],[2297,["They have no news about it."]],[2300,["They don’t understand."]],[2301,["They should not ask any questions."]],[2303,["Those who are Sahaja Yogis should ask."]],[2305,["I mean, it would be something like those who","have never visited India, are asking questions"]],[2311,["about India."]],[2312,["Better go to India, find out about [it] yourself,","see it in deeply, how it is, what it is, and"]],[2319,["then you can ask questions."]],[2321,["Not just visit Delhi talk to some Westernised","Indians and come back and tell me stories"]],[2326,["about them!"]],[2327,["In the same way, those who have not been to","England, meet some of the politicians or something"]],[2333,["like that, go back and tell something about","England which I will not believe and you should"]],[2342,["not believe."]],[2343,["You have to understand the country on a philosophical","level, on philosophy – where are they."]],[2349,["And unless and until you understand that subtle","thing, you cannot say anything about it."]],[2356,["For example, for England, I have always said","that the young generation of England are the"]],[2363,["best in the whole world."]],[2364,["Take it from me, whether they are English,","or whatever it is, whatever nationality, but"]],[2371,["the young generation that are English are","the best."]],[2375,["No doubt about it."]],[2377,["Because they have developed, no doubt, but","they have kept their wisdom intact."]],[2383,["India, the young people are developing and","they have to go through all your discotheques"]],[2388,["and all those rumble-tumbles, till they come","to the stage where they’ll take alcohols"]],[2392,["and then they will take to your drugs and","then they might take to [seeking]."]],[2398,["Americans are too shifty."]],[2400,["They have not kept their wisdom intact."]],[2404,["(laughter) But thanks to the tradition of","British, that you have kept your traditions"]],[2413,["still intact and you know about your country","because it’s a small country."]],[2419,["So I depend very much on the English youth."]],[2424,["But if you ask anyone else, they will say,","“Oh, these English youth [are] extremely"]],[2428,["rude, arrogant."]],[2429,["Good for nothing!"]],[2432,["Drugged, lethargic."]],[2433,["Useless!”"]],[2434,["But I have seen now young people and young","people all over the world and this is what"]],[2440,["I have to say about them."]],[2443,["Now I would like you to ask me questions."]],[2446,["First the Sahaja yogis, then we can ask the","non-Sahaja yogis."]],[2457,["Difficult."]],[2459,["You have become thoughtless, actually, you","cannot ask!"]],[2464,["This is the trick of Sahaja Yoga!"]],[2468,["When it crosses this point, you cannot think."]],[2471,["Even if you want to think, you cannot."]],[2478,["No questions?"]],[2483,["Now non-sahaja yogis, please."]],[2485,["Seeker: How about times when you should do","the meditation?"]],[2490,["What sort of times?"]],[2491,["Shri Mataji: Oh, there’s nothing."]],[2492,["No rules."]],[2493,["You go beyond time."]],[2494,["Every time you are in meditation only."]],[2495,["You see, what is meditation?"]],[2498,["You cannot do meditation, you have to be in","meditation."]],[2500,["You become meditative."]],[2501,["You are all the time in meditation."]],[2503,["I mean, there is no time when you are not,","because you become a different person."]],[2512,["Those people who do meditation, I don’t","know how they do it."]],[2516,["Really, I can’t understand."]],[2517,["Because which is the way you enter into the","realm of meditation?"]],[2521,["Unless and until the Kundalini takes your","attention to that state,you cannot meditate."]],[2527,["So how can you do?"]],[2528,["You cannot lift the Kundalini with your hand","and put Her there."]],[2532,["No lift can work it out."]],[2535,["It’s only through spontaneous awakening","that the Kundalini rises."]],[2540,["So you cannot do meditation."]],[2542,["And once you are there, you are there."]],[2546,["So there is no timing."]],[2549,["Nothing fixed."]],[2550,["But it depends on the kind of a person they","are."]],[2555,["For example, say somebody who gets up [at]","eleven o’clock in the morning, doesn’t"]],[2566,["brush his teeth, rushes to the office, comes","back home, sleeps at two o’clock in the"]],[2575,["night, can’t sleep before two o’clock,","then such a person has to develop certain"]],[2579,["habits."]],[2581,["Because we have to neutralise the habits that","we have had."]],[2585,["So maybe that time we will have to just turn","the tables, and we can manage."]],[2589,["We can change all our habits."]],[2592,["And we can have such habits by which we neutralise","our old habits."]],[2597,["It depends on what sort of a person it is."]],[2600,["For example, we Indians have a bad habit of","getting up very early in the morning and having"]],[2605,["a bath in the morning."]],[2608,["Whether it is England, America or even if","we are with Eskimos, we’ll do that!"]],[2612,["That’s typical."]],[2613,["Otherwise, we don’t feel happy."]],[2615,["Just before going to the office, we’ll take","our baths and walk out in the cold."]],[2620,["I mean, it is the greatest punishment for","an Indian to say, “You don’t take your"]],[2625,["bath.\""]],[2626,["I mean, after coming to England some of them","have reconciled."]],[2629,["And to take bath in the night and sleep, they","can’t believe it, they just don’t know"]],[2636,["what it is."]],[2638,["So they get lung troubles."]],[2641,["Some of them have got lung cancer."]],[2642,["One of the common diseases I’ve seen amongst","Indians is what you call the, we call it the"]],[2648,["heart chakras, the, the cardiac plexus catching;","common."]],[2653,["The reason is this, that, they have no consideration","about the temperature outside."]],[2660,["Now if you tell them, they can’t believe","me."]],[2665,["They think a religious person must take his","bath every day."]],[2668,["That’s the idea they have."]],[2671,["Not in England."]],[2673,["I mean, you can take your bath every day,","but not the bath and just walk out [of the"]],[2678,["house]."]],[2679,["Then I have to tell, “Can you have you bath,","say, thrice a week or four times a week, if"]],[2687,["possible?”"]],[2688,["But to an Englishmen, you better get up at","four o’clock and have your bath!"]],[2693,["It depends on who you are."]],[2695,["So there is nothing like having a fixed thing","in Sahaja Yoga."]],[2704,["It depends on what sort of a person you have,","what habits are there, what are your loopholes,"]],[2708,["what are your weaknesses."]],[2710,["So we have to look after that."]],[2711,["Like, it’s very common practice, you know."]],[2715,["Supposing we have to go to my house from here."]],[2719,["Now you don’t know how to go, so you see","the map and whichever way you have to go,"]],[2723,["you just go."]],[2724,["It’s a new life."]],[2726,["It’s a new map."]],[2728,["So you have to see which way you have to go."]],[2731,["You change accordingly and you go accordingly."]],[2734,["You cannot have fixed idea now, anymore."]],[2737,["You have to see."]],[2739,["If your car has got a trouble with its brake,","better is to repair the brake, isn’t it?"]],[2745,["Or will you say that, “Doesn’t matter."]],[2747,["Even [if] my brake is bad, I’ll go ahead."]],[2751,["As long as my tyres are alright, I don’t","care for the brake.\""]],[2754,["Sahaja Yoga is just opposite."]],[2756,["If the brake is not alright, don’t worry","about the tyres, but think about the brake."]],[2761,["It’s very discretionary."]],[2764,["You become very discrete about yourself and","you start repairing your car; that’s yourself."]],[2769,["Because you get out of your car and you see","the problems."]],[2773,["You are not identified anymore with you."]],[2777,["For example, Don would come and tell Me, “Mother,","I am catching on my Agnya here.\""]],[2781,["Now what does that mean?"]],[2783,["It means actually Ego."]],[2785,["But he will have no objection in telling me","or he will in no way feel ashamed to tell"]],[2790,["me that, “My ego is like a balloon here","coming up Mother."]],[2794,["Better solve the problem.\""]],[2796,["You see your ego so clearly and you want to","get rid of it."]],[2802,["Anybody would do that."]],[2804,["But if you tell somebody before Realisation,","“You have got ego,” you’ve had it."]],[2810,["I have never done that and none of you should","do."]],[2813,["Let them feel the Agnya after Realisation."]],[2816,["They come and tell you and you move it."]],[2818,["In the same way, any other trouble, even for","diseases, if you tell somebody that, “You"]],[2823,["have such disease,” he may jump down from","here with fear."]],[2826,["In Sahaja Yoga you come to know about the","diseases much, much before any doctors know,"]],[2832,["because on your fingers you can feel it."]],[2836,["But you don’t have to tell the person at","all."]],[2838,["You just talk in your code language."]],[2840,["What is catching?"]],[2842,["You tell, “This is catching."]],[2843,["Ekadasha Rudra is catching.\""]],[2845,["Alright, what does that mean?"]],[2847,["That is the beginning of the cancer."]],[2850,["There’s already for it."]],[2852,["So Ekadasha."]],[2853,["Clear out the Ekadasha Rudra, is all here","(pointing to forehead)."]],[2857,["Now nobody knows what Ekadasha Rudra is, except","for the Sahaja yogis."]],[2861,["And they know there is no danger because it","is curable."]],[2865,["So they clear it out."]],[2866,["That’s the beginning of a personality, where","he starts getting into this trouble or that"]],[2873,["trouble."]],[2874,["And say left Agnya is catching, is a sign","that he is going lunatic asylum and little"]],[2882,["combinations."]],[2883,["You don’t have to tell the person but you","can save him from going to lunatic asylum."]],[2887,["He need never go."]],[2889,["People have come down to our program to lunatic","asylum and when they went back, they were"]],[2894,["told, “You better not come up here.\""]],[2896,["It can happen like that."]],[2898,["It’s very simple."]],[2899,["It is so simple, you can’t imagine."]],[2901,["The whole thing is so simple but you have","to learn what it is."]],[2906,["You can cure people."]],[2909,["You can help your atmosphere."]],[2911,["You can do lots of things."]],[2913,["The greatest of all that you become the collective","being."]],[2919,["So it changes."]],[2920,["There’s no time, nothing."]],[2922,["You are a free bird."]],[2924,["It’s all freedom."]],[2925,["There’s no bondage."]],[2926,["You yourself want to sit down meditating."]],[2928,["Now I came here, I was supposed to talk and","start my speech but I was enjoying my meditation"]],[2935,["so much so I went into that."]],[2938,["All the time you are in meditation mood and","you can enjoy it anytime you want to"]],[2947,["Seeker: Do you hope to come back to England","in the near future?"]],[2953,["Shri Mataji: No, no, I am stationed here."]],[2955,["Absolutely, I am glued to this place for five","years more!"]],[2964,["And I am going to come back very soon."]],[2967,["I am there only for two months, or one month","I will be going to Australia."]],[2973,["So [after] three months altogether, I’m","back."]],[2976,["I’m sure even when I go back after five","years, your government won’t object [to]"]],[2982,["my coming here."]],[2983,["I hope so by that time."]],[2985,["So, it’s just I had to come here."]],[2987,["I have been now here seven years and five","years more."]],[2991,["Twelve years!"]],[2993,["Can you imagine?"]],[2996,["Alright?"]],[2997,["That should set you alright."]],[3001,["That was one of the fears is it?"]],[3004,["No."]],[3005,["Now is it alright for all of you?"]],[3006,["Anyone else?"]],[3007,["Sahaja Yogi: You can tell us something about","dharma Mother."]],[3010,["Shri Mataji: Dharma?"]],[3011,["Sahaja Yogi: Yes."]],[3012,["Shri Mataji: There’s a, there’s a tape","on dharma and on Guru which you can see."]],[3018,["Dharma is the sustenance which is established","by an aspect of God in our stomach."]],[3031,["Our stomach teaches us our dharma."]],[3034,["“Dharayati sa dharmaha”, means the one","you sustain is your dharma."]],[3040,["For example, the dharma of gold is that it","is untarnishable."]],[3049,["The dharma of carbon is [that] it has got","four valencies."]],[3053,["If you have seen the periodic laws of chemistry,","you will know that all the elements have got"]],[3060,["their own dharmas."]],[3063,["And they are given these dharmas by the law","of God."]],[3068,["It’s the Divine Law which has given them","these dharmas."]],[3073,["Up to the stage of human beings the dharma","of a person or of any animal, or of any element,"]],[3085,["is determined absolutely by divine laws and","they do not cross it."]],[3090,["For example, a lion will behave like a lion."]],[3095,["He cannot behave like a cat."]],[3097,["A scorpion will behave like itself."]],[3104,["It cannot behave like a lion."]],[3107,["A tiger will behave like a tiger."]],[3110,["Tiger is the king and he won’t eat anything","killed by another animal."]],[3117,["Only when he is hungry, he kills the animal","and he eats whatever he likes in one gulp"]],[3123,["and then he rests and others come and eat","that."]],[3126,["He won’t eat anything that is eaten by others","and he won’t kill anything that he need"]],[3136,["not kill."]],[3137,["He’s the king."]],[3138,["That’s why if one tiger is killed in a forest","the whole forest seems so gloomy."]],[3145,["Because their king has been killed."]],[3148,["Though he’s a terror for them."]],[3150,["But he lives with his own dharma, with his","own boundaries."]],[3156,["He doesn’t cross his boundaries."]],[3158,["Any one of these, up to the human level, have","their own dharmas."]],[3164,["Only the human beings have been given the","freedom to cross the dharma, they can."]],[3174,["I mean, in a human being, you can find a lion,","you can find a serpent and you can find also"]],[3182,["a worm."]],[3184,["You can find the combination of all that in","one person or in the whole group you’ll"]],[3188,["find all kinds."]],[3192,["But if they want they can transcend."]],[3195,["And the greatest thing is [that] they can","transcend the dharma itself."]],[3199,["Means they become so great that they can be","sinless."]],[3205,["Just they can’t do any sins."]],[3209,["These dharmas are established within you."]],[3211,["These Ten Commandments are there within us."]],[3215,["If you try to transgress them you are losing","your dharma, your sustenance, beyond which"]],[3222,["you have to rise."]],[3224,["For Realisation, you have to rise beyond dharma,","dharmateet – beyond."]],[3230,["But first your dharma must be established."]],[3234,["If it is not established, you cannot rise."]],[3237,["But in Sahaja Yoga, even [if] your dharma","is disturbed it’s forgiven."]],[3245,["Still you can get your Realisation."]],[3248,["Then you establish your dharma."]],[3250,["It’s better."]],[3252,["Because it has been seen [that] those people","who tried to establish their dharmas can become"]],[3256,["extremely, extremely dry."]],[3263,["They can be fanatics."]],[3264,["The compassion part of it is lost."]],[3265,["So the compassion itself works in such a way","that all adharmas you have done, whatever"]],[3275,["you have done is forgiven."]],[3277,["And you better have your Realisation and with","that power you establish your dharma."]],[3281,["And you have to establish it."]],[3284,["For example, you know that alcohol goes against","your awareness."]],[3290,["Awareness is the main thing, which is enlivened,","enriched by dharma."]],[3294,["The human awareness goes down through alcohol,","you know [this] for definite."]],[3299,["All the great saints who have looked after","the dharma, the prophets, have said against"]],[3308,["alcohol and against smoking."]],[3311,["Mohammed Saheb did not say about smoking because","they did not have smoking."]],[3316,["But the same person came as Nanaka."]],[3319,["As Guru Nanaka he has prohibited, absolutely","prohibited anything that intoxicates you,"]],[3327,["your awareness."]],[3329,["Because they knew that it will harm you very","much."]],[3333,["It does harm you."]],[3336,["You lose the chances of your Realisation very","much."]],[3338,["It is true that it is injurious."]],[3343,["One thing as alcoholism, I am saying."]],[3347,["There can be something else people do, like","thieving or anything like that, is against"]],[3356,["your sustenance."]],[3358,["But Sahaja Yoga is a method by which you first","get your Realisation and then your dharma"]],[3366,["is to be established so that you are empowered","by itself."]],[3371,["For example, I never tell people, “Don’t","drink,” because half of the people would"]],[3377,["walk out, even Indians."]],[3380,["They just drink like – I don’t know – fishes."]],[3386,["I don’t know if fishes drink, but human","beings do!"]],[3390,["And then if I tell them, they will be very","angry."]],[3395,["We had a doctor here who used to drink who","came to me."]],[3400,["He got his Realisation and he went to Germany."]],[3404,["And he was fond of a kind of a wine, a special","wine they make in Germany."]],[3409,["He said, “Let me try some of this.\""]],[3411,["He had given up because you don’t remember","that you have to drink."]],[3414,["You never get bored enough to drink!"]],[3416,["You see, you feel, “What’s the use of","getting up and getting a glass and all that?"]],[3420,["I am enjoying myself."]],[3421,["Why to do?”"]],[3422,["You are never bored of your company."]],[3424,["You enjoy yourself so much that you don’t","want any drink."]],[3427,["Like when you get the nectar of life, why","should you get after these horrible things?"]],[3432,["You just don’t do it."]],[3435,["But this doctor thought, “Oh, how can that","be?"]],[3436,["I may have forgotten but today I’ll have","it.\""]],[3439,["So he walked into a pub and asked for the","thing."]],[3441,["He drank."]],[3444,["After that he had such a pain, he vomited","all that."]],[3447,["And he told me, “The same wine which I used","to enjoy, started smelling like cork to me."]],[3454,["As if cork has been pushed into my tongue."]],[3457,["I just couldn’t bear it and I vomited and","I had pain in the stomach."]],[3462,["Mother what is this?”"]],[3463,["I said, “Alright, it’s good!”"]],[3466,["You cannot do then adharma."]],[3468,["You just cannot do it."]],[3471,["You just become dharma."]],[3472,["You just cannot do it even if you try."]],[3476,["It just works."]],[3477,["I mean, there are people here, at least fifty","percent people, who have been druggists and"]],[3484,["chemists!"]],[3485,["Absolutely!"]],[3486,["They have given [up] drugs just like that."]],[3489,["Just like that they have given [up] drugs."]],[3493,["Of course, they had to get over the after-effects","of drugs."]],[3495,["That’s different."]],[3496,["But as far as giving up is concerned, no problem","at all, no problem of any kind."]],[3501,["I didn’t have to tell them even, it just","happened."]],[3505,["Dharma is established within you, because","when the light is there you see what it is."]],[3512,["But this seeing is not what you understand","before Realisation – is through your rational"]],[3518,["being or through your sense organs – but","is a happening within you where you become"]],[3525,["that, you just feel it."]],[3528,["You just can’t help it."]],[3532,["That should happen; is the best, because human","beings otherwise are difficult."]],[3537,["They find it difficult to maintain it."]],[3541,["Now, I mean, everything they surpassed."]],[3544,["First they use to say, “What about our social","relationships?”"]],[3549,["Their social relationships have improved,","their jobs have improved, their all material"]],[3555,["things have improved."]],[3556,["If you don’t drink, I mean you save fifty","percent of your money as it is!"]],[3561,["[It’s] practical apart from anything else!"]],[3564,["But, according to Sahaja Yoga it’s much","subtler because the power of maintaining our"]],[3573,["material well-being is called as Lakshmi."]],[3578,["And this Lakshmi is a very powerful deity","or a very powerful thing."]],[3584,["But, alcoholism, alcohol is one thing or any","such things like drugs and all that, as soon"]],[3591,["as she sees entering into the being, she just","disappears."]],[3596,["She just can’t bear it."]],[3599,["So a person may think that by drinking he","doesn’t lose his money [but] he is sadly"]],[3605,["mistaken."]],[3606,["If he does not drink he will have ten times","more money than he has."]],[3612,["And you can see the result today that, when","Englishmen were known in India, Englishmen’s"]],[3618,["whisky meant this much, every night; that’s","all."]],[3622,["Today if you see the same thing in third generation,","you’ll be shocked."]],[3626,["I mean, first time I came to England I was","surprised because to us Englishmen means one"]],[3631,["peck, so little, before sleeping, very decent."]],[3636,["That’s what we thought they were gentlemen","of that calibre."]],[3640,["But when I saw here, I was surprised."]],[3642,["“Oh, God, what is this?"]],[3644,["What Englishmen are these?”"]],[3645,["So this happens in [the] third generation."]],[3648,["If alcoholism somehow or other reduces in","England you can surpass all the economic problems;"]],[3656,["take it from me."]],[3659,["Absolutely!"]],[3660,["You’ll solve all your economics."]],[3663,["Just stop alcohols."]],[3665,["All your strikes will stop because they want","money for what?"]],[3668,["For alcohols only."]],[3671,["If you get money – have an alcohol."]],[3674,["Somebody dies – have champagne."]],[3676,["Somebody passes – champagne."]],[3678,["Somebody married – champagne."]],[3679,["For everything there is a champagne!"]],[3683,["Even in the church you see barrels and barrels","of whisky flowing in."]],[3687,["Barrels and barrels of this thing is flowing","in."]],[3689,["In mean, even in the church!"]],[3691,["Now today somebody told me that he’s got","a special wine from a Catholic church, which"]],[3699,["is called as Benedicts and is a special one."]],[3701,["I said, “Where did you buy that?”"]],[3703,["He said, “In Rome, in the Vatican."]],[3705,["You can only get it there, the best!”"]],[3706,["I was surprised that you can only get it in","Vatican and he was so proud of it and he was"]],[3718,["showing me that!"]],[3719,["And now it is called as ‘Benedict’."]],[3723,["Just imagine!"]],[3724,["‘Benediction’."]],[3725,["‘Benediction’ is that which gives you","Realisation."]],[3728,["What Realisation does the drinking give you?"]],[3731,["I don’t know."]],[3732,["Only thing I have seen [is] that people fall","on the streets, they talk like stupid people."]],[3737,["You don’t know what to do with them."]],[3740,["It’s most embarrassing."]],[3742,["So this is what is dharma is, that is just","enlightens you and you enjoy your virtues."]],[3749,["Not your weaknesses but your virtues."]],[3752,["And you enjoy the virtues of others."]],[3753,["That’s what is dharma that has to be enlightened."]],[3757,["May God Bless you!"]],[3760,["You have to just put your hands just like","this, just like this."]],[3764,["Put both the feet on the ground."]],[3770,["Please close your eyes."]],[3773,["According to the way the Kundalini is moving,","which I know on my own Kundalini, I will ask"]],[3779,["you a few things."]],[3781,["Please try to do them with earnestness and","alertness."]],[3789,["Now, I have to request you to forgive everyone."]],[3794,["Forgive everyone: those who have troubled","you, tortured you, have made you unhappy,"]],[3799,["anyone."]],[3800,["You just say, “I forgive.\""]],[3801,["Is very important."]],[3802,["Just try to forgive."]],[3804,["Say, “I forgive."]],[3806,["Mother, I forgive."]],[3809,["I forgive all of them, all the people who","have tortured me.\""]],[3819,["Just say that from your heart."]],[3822,["Please say that, “I forgive.\""]],[3825,["Please close your eyes."]],[3828,["You have to be honest to yourself."]],[3832,["Just say that, “I forgive.\""]],[3835,["Only saying is sufficient."]],[3838,["Only saying."]],[3839,["But say with the heart."]],[3842,["It will help you a lot if you can say that."]],[3849,["Forgive everyone."]],[3851,["Everyone you forgive."]],[3854,["When you forgive everyone, actually you leave","it into the hands of God to punish them or"]],[3860,["do whatever they like."]],[3861,["And that’s the best [way] to manage the","thing."]],[3863,["Just say, “I forgive.\""]],[3865,["Best thing is to leave it to God to do the","job whatever it is."]],[3875,["You don’t take the load."]],[3884,["They may be nasty."]],[3886,["They may be horrid."]],[3888,["They might have tortured you."]],[3890,["Doesn’t matter."]],[3891,["Just say."]],[3892,["Even Christ said that."]],[3894,["Just again, please say it."]],[3897,["Close your eyes and say it, because if you","do not forgive also, what do you do?"]],[3909,["You are playing into their hands."]],[3912,["Nothing is harmed, they are not harmed by","your not forgiving them."]],[3921,["It’s you [who] are harmed."]],[3923,["Because you are remembering all that, you","are harming yourself."]],[3928,["You are tortured by that."]],[3929,["You are torturing yourself not they."]],[3930,["Now the second thing you have to ask [for]","is the forgiveness, yourself."]],[3936,["Because might be some mistakes must have been","committed."]],[3937,["By mistake you might have done something wrong,","something unrighteous."]],[3939,["In seeking, you might have done something","wrong."]],[3946,["So just ask for God to forgive you, that’s","all."]],[3951,["You put your right hand on your heart and","ask for forgiveness."]],[3958,["It will be better."]],[3959,["Left hand towards me and right hand on the","heart."]],[3965,["Now, [while] asking this, you must know that","He is the ocean of compassion."]],[3971,["He is the ocean of forgiveness and He is the","ocean of love and He is anxious for you to"]],[3979,["enter into His Kingdom."]],[3982,["He is the One who wants the culmination of","His Creation into a beautiful happening by"]],[3990,["which He gives you the complete joy of your","being."]],[3993,["So you just ask for His forgiveness but do","not feel guilty about anything."]],[4004,["Whatever has happened, has happened, is forgiven."]],[4009,["So you just say that, “If there is anything,","please forgive.\""]],[4017,["But do not feel guilty."]],[4021,["I think best thing is to say, “I’m not","guilty.\""]],[4029,["Again and again to say that, “I am not guilty.\""]],[4035,["Because that’s a very common practice here,","to feel guilty."]],[4042,["Let Him judge you."]],[4043,["Not to feel guilty at all is very important."]],[4044,["Please tell yourself thrice that, “I am","not guilty.\""]],[4045,["Now the Kundalini will rise and you will feel","absolutely thoughtless."]],[4046,["There’s no thought in your mind."]],[4048,["You’ll see that."]],[4049,["Just see it: is there any thought in your","mind."]]]);
